  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Aid for regain normalcy from Morocco earthquake</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A devastating magnitude 6.8 earthquake struck Morocco on the night of 8 September local time, with a death toll of more than 3,000. This is the largest earthquake to hit Morocco in 60 years, since 1960, so it is time for a rapid response. The aim of the project is to help the victims of the Moroccan earthquake recover from the earthquake damage as quickly as possible and return to their daily lives.</narrative>
  </description>
